doctype html
html(lang='en')

    head
        meta(charset='utf-8')
        meta(name='viewport', content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1')
        meta(name='description', content='TopoStrawberry-RGBD is a synchronized greenhouse RGB-D strawberry dataset with 3,758 frames, 14,286 instances, bounding boxes, five keypoints, ripeness, and occlusion annotations.')
        meta(name='theme-color', content='#17364d')
        meta(property='og:type', content='website')
        meta(property='og:title', content='TopoStrawberry')
        meta(property='og:description', content='TopoStrawberry-RGBD: 3,758 synchronized RGB-D frames with 14,286 instance annotations and 71,430 anatomical keypoints.')
        meta(property='og:url', content='https://strawberry-vision-dataset.yuhao-jin.chatgpt.site/')
        meta(property='og:image', content='https://strawberry-vision-dataset.yuhao-jin.chatgpt.site/assets/og-strawberry-dataset.jpg')
        meta(name='twitter:card', content='summary_large_image')
        title TopoStrawberry | TopoStrawberry-RGBD

        link(rel='canonical', href='https://strawberry-vision-dataset.yuhao-jin.chatgpt.site/')
        link(rel='icon', type='image/png', sizes='64x64', href='assets/strawberry-favicon.png?v=pink')
        link(rel='apple-touch-icon', href='assets/strawberry-mascot.png?v=pink')
        include includes/css.pug

    body
        a.skip-link(href='#main-content') Skip to content

        include includes/navbar.pug

        main#main-content
            header#overview.research-hero
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .project-label Controlled-access dataset | July 2026

                    h1 TopoStrawberry: A Large-Scale Harvest-Oriented RGB-D Dataset with Topological Keypoint Refinement and Keypoint-Anchored Harvest-State Recognition

                    .row.g-5.align-items-center
                        .col-lg-5
                            p.hero-abstract
                                | TopoStrawberry-RGBD contains 3,758 paired frames and 14,286 annotated strawberry instances. Each annotated strawberry includes a bounding box, five anatomical keypoints, a ripeness label, and an occlusion label.

                            .d-flex.flex-wrap.gap-2.mt-3.mb-4
                                a.btn.btn-research(href='#resources') Download dataset
                                a.btn.btn-outline-research(href='#statistics') View dataset statistics

                            dl.project-metadata
                                .metadata-row
                                    dt Modalities
                                    dd RGB images, aligned depth maps, post-processed depth maps, and raw depth maps
                                .metadata-row
                                    dt Annotations
                                    dd Bounding boxes, keypoints, ripeness labels, and occlusion labels in LabelMe JSON format
                                .metadata-row
                                    dt Research tasks
                                    dd Object detection, keypoint estimation, ripeness recognition, and occlusion recognition
                                .metadata-row
                                    dt Capture system
                                    dd Four Intel RealSense D435i cameras
                                .metadata-row
                                    dt Image resolution
                                    dd 1280 × 720 pixels
                                .metadata-row
                                    dt Dataset split
                                    dd Train 2,630 / Validation 564 / Test 564 frames (70% / 15% / 15%)

                        .col-lg-7
                            figure.research-figure.hero-figure
                                .figure-frame.figure-frame--clean
                                    img(
                                        src='assets/dataset-annotation-overview.webp',
                                        alt='Representative greenhouse RGB frame with strawberry bounding boxes, five landmark types, ripeness categories, and occlusion categories',
                                        width='1800',
                                        height='1080',
                                        fetchpriority='high'
                                    )
                                figcaption
                                    span.figure-number Figure 1.
                                    |  Real annotation overlay from train/0238; category IDs are shown exactly as stored.

            section#statistics.paper-section
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .section-heading
                        span.section-number 01
                        div
                            p.section-type Dataset statistics
                            h2 Dataset snapshot
                    p.section-summary
                        | The dataset contains 3,758 frames organized into training, validation, and test sets. Dataset-wide counts cover synchronized modalities and the per-image camera calibration mapping.
                    .dataset-stat-grid
                        article.dataset-stat
                            span.stat-kicker Frames
                            strong 3,758
                            p Synchronized RGB-D samples
                        article.dataset-stat
                            span.stat-kicker Instances
                            strong 14,286
                            p Strawberry bounding boxes
                        article.dataset-stat
                            span.stat-kicker Keypoints
                            strong 71,430
                            p Five keypoints per instance
                        article.dataset-stat
                            span.stat-kicker Storage
                            strong 7.11 GB
                            p 18,795 files in total
                    .integrity-grid
                        article.integrity-item
                            div
                                h3 Cross-modal pairing
                                p All 3,758 frames include complete RGB, label, aligned-depth, post-processed-depth, and raw-depth data.
                        article.integrity-item
                            div
                                h3 Annotation structure
                                p Each strawberry instance is annotated with five keypoints representing its Cut, Top, Bottom, Left, and Right positions.
                        article.integrity-item
                            div
                                h3 Calibration mapping
                                p Each image record is mapped to one of four RealSense camera calibration files.
                    .directory-structure-slot(aria-labelledby='directory-structure-title')
                        .directory-slot-copy
                            span.directory-slot-index
                            div
                                p.annotation-eyebrow Dataset organization
                                h3#directory-structure-title Dataset directory structure
                                p The directory structure describes how modalities, dataset splits, annotations, and calibration files are organized.
                        .directory-slot-canvas(aria-label='Reserved area for the final dataset directory tree')
                            .directory-slot-label
                                span Dataset directory structure
                            .directory-placeholder(aria-hidden='true')
                                span.placeholder-root
                                .placeholder-branch
                                    span
                                    span
                                    span
                                .placeholder-branch.placeholder-branch--short
                                    span
                                    span
            section#composition.paper-section.paper-section--alt
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .section-heading
                        span.section-number 02
                        div
                            p.section-type Dataset analysis
                            h2 Composition and label balance
                    p.section-summary
                        | The dataset uses a 70% / 15% / 15% train/validation/test split: 2,630 training frames, 564 validation frames, and 564 test frames. All 3,758 synchronized RGB-D records are retained. Per-split instance statistics are pending; blank cells indicate values not yet reported.
                    .composition-grid
                        .table-responsive.collection-table-wrap
                            table.collection-table
                                caption Train/validation/test sample counts and available instance statistics
                                thead
                                    tr
                                        th(scope='col') Split
                                        th(scope='col') Frames
                                        th(scope='col') Share
                                        th(scope='col') Instances
                                        th(scope='col') Inst./frame
                                tbody
                                    tr
                                        th(scope='row') Train
                                        td 2,630
                                        td 70%
                                        td
                                        td
                                    tr
                                        th(scope='row') Validation
                                        td 564
                                        td 15%
                                        td
                                        td
                                    tr
                                        th(scope='row') Test
                                        td 564
                                        td 15%
                                        td
                                        td
                                tfoot
                                    tr
                                        th(scope='row') Total
                                        td 3,758
                                        td 100%
                                        td 14,286
                                        td 3.80
                        .label-summary
                            h3 Label encoding

                            .label-group-row 
                                p.label-group-title Instance attributes
                                p.label-group-title Keypoint attributes

                            .label-definition-grid

                                .label-definition-item.label-definition-item--ripeness
                                    h4 Ripeness
                                    .label-row
                                        span 0
                                        span Immature
                                        span 4,957 (34.7%)
                                    .label-row
                                        span 1
                                        span Mature
                                        span 9,329 (65.3%)

                                .label-definition-item.label-definition-item--occlusion
                                    h4 Occlusion
                                    .label-row
                                        span 0
                                        span Non-occluded
                                        span 9,278 (64.9%)
                                    .label-row
                                        span 1
                                        span Occluded
                                        span 5,008 (35.1%)

                                .label-definition-item.label-definition-item--keypoint
                                    h4 Keypoint visibility
                                    .label-row
                                        span 0
                                        span Outside image
                                        span 774 (1.1%)
                                    .label-row
                                        span 1
                                        span Occluded but inferable
                                        span 10,062 (14.1%)
                                    .label-row
                                        span 2
                                        span Visible
                                        span 60,594 (84.8%)

                    figure.research-figure.data-figure
                        .figure-frame.figure-frame--clean
                            img(src='assets/dataset-distributions.webp', alt='Charts showing train, validation, and test frame counts, available per-split instance counts, and ripeness, occlusion, and keypoint visibility distributions', width='1800', height='1250', loading='lazy')
                        figcaption
                            span.figure-number Figure 2.
                            |  Dataset-wide counts. Ripeness labels: 0 = immature, 1 = mature; occlusion labels: 0 = non-occluded, 1 = occluded. Keypoint visibility states: 0 = outside the image, 1 = occluded but inferable, and 2 = visible.
            section#protocol.paper-section
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .section-heading
                        span.section-number 03
                        div
                            p.section-type Data specification
                            h2 Modalities and annotation protocol
                    p.section-summary
                        | Every four-digit sample ID identifies one synchronized record inside train, validation, or test. Post-processed aligned depth is used for the 3D visualization below, with calibration selected from the dataset-wide image-to-camera mapping.
                    .table-responsive.protocol-table-wrap
                        table.protocol-table
                            thead
                                tr
                                    th(scope='col') Data modality
                                    th(scope='col') File format
                                    th(scope='col') Count
                                    th(scope='col') Purpose
                            tbody
                                tr
                                    th(scope='row') RGB
                                    td 1280 × 720 PNG
                                    td 3,758
                                    td Appearance, localization, and attribute recognition
                                tr
                                    th(scope='row') Aligned depth
                                    td 16-bit depth PNG aligned to color
                                    td 3,758
                                    td RGB-D fusion and metric geometry
                                tr
                                    th(scope='row') Processed depth
                                    td Spatial, temporal, and hole-filled aligned depth
                                    td 3,758
                                    td Stable visualization and downstream geometry
                                tr
                                    th(scope='row') Raw depth
                                    td Original 16-bit depth PNG
                                    td 3,758
                                    td Reprocessing and sensor-level studies
                                tr
                                    th(scope='row') Instance label
                                    td LabelMe JSON
                                    td 3,758
                                    td Boxes, five keypoints, ripeness, and occlusion
                                tr
                                    th(scope='row') Calibration map
                                    td Per-image XLSX mapping plus four camera JSON files
                                    td 3,758
                                    td Select the correct camera intrinsics for metric reconstruction
                    .annotation-schema(aria-labelledby='annotation-schema-title')
                        .annotation-json
                            .annotation-json-header
                                div
                                    p.annotation-eyebrow Annotation hierarchy
                                    h3#annotation-schema-title LabelMe JSON schema
                                span.annotation-format 3 levels
                            .json-tree(role='tree', aria-label='JSON annotation field hierarchy')
                                .json-tree-root(role='treeitem', aria-expanded='true')
                                    span.tree-bracket {
                                    span.tree-label Root
                                .json-tree-branch
                                    .json-tree-item(role='treeitem')
                                        code version
                                        span.tree-type 5.5.0
                                    .json-tree-item(role='treeitem')
                                        code flags
                                        span.tree-type object
                                    .json-tree-item.json-tree-item--group(role='treeitem', aria-expanded='true')
                                        code shapes[]
                                        span.tree-type ordered annotation objects
                                    .json-tree-branch.json-tree-branch--nested(role='group')
                                        .json-tree-node(role='treeitem', aria-expanded='true')
                                            .json-tree-node-title
                                                span.tree-node-kind Instance
                                                code shape_type: rectangle
                                            .tree-field-list
                                                span label
                                                span points: 2 bbox corners
                                                span group_id
                                                span occlusion
                                                span ripeness
                                        .json-tree-node(role='treeitem', aria-expanded='true')
                                            .json-tree-node-title
                                                span.tree-node-kind Keypoints
                                                code shape_type: point
                                            .tree-field-list
                                                span label
                                                span points: (x, y)
                                                span group_id
                                                span visibility
                                    .json-tree-more(role='treeitem')
                                        span.tree-ellipsis … repeat for each instance
                                    .json-tree-item.json-tree-item--close(role='treeitem')
                                        code imagePath · imageData
                                        span.tree-type image metadata
                                    .json-tree-item(role='treeitem')
                                        code imageHeight · imageWidth
                                        span.tree-type integer
                                .json-tree-close(aria-hidden='true') }
                        .annotation-guide
                            article.schema-group
                                span.schema-index 01
                                .schema-copy
                                    h3 Structure
                                    p The JSON file stores image metadata and annotations. All labels are organized in 
                                        code shapes[]
                                        | .
                            article.schema-group
                                span.schema-index 02
                                .schema-copy
                                    h3 Instance
                                    p Each strawberry instance is represented by one bounding box. 
                                        code points 
                                        | defines the bounding box, while 
                                        code group_id 
                                        | links the instance with its attributes and keypoints.
                                    .schema-fields
                                        code label: strawberry
                                        code points: 2 × [x, y] (top-left & bottom-right corners)
                                        code group_id: instance id
                                        code ripeness: 0 | 1
                                        code occlusion: 0 | 1
                            article.schema-group
                                span.schema-index 03
                                .schema-copy
                                    h3 Keypoints
                                    p Each strawberry contains five anatomical keypoints: Cut, Top, Bottom, Left, and Right. 
                                        code group_id
                                        | associates each point with its instance, and 
                                        code visibility 
                                        | records keypoint visibility.
                                    .schema-fields
                                        code label: Cut | Top | Bottom | Left | Right
                                        code points: [x, y] (location)
                                        code group_id: instance id
                                        code visibility: 0 | 1 | 2

